            <ArticleTitle>Adrenal myelolipoma with abdominal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>254-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of adrenal myelolipoma with abdominal pain. Preoperative diagnosis was correctly made by computed tomography and magnetic resonance imaging. We have reviewed the literature and discuss the contribution of modern imaging techniques to the diagnosis of this tumor.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
